            {
              "id": "1762212156474_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your job is to present the final answer in following JSON output schema based on input variable values. \nDo not include $schema in output. \nReturn only the JSON object, no extra text.\n\n## Output Format\n{\"shortSummary\": \"<short 1–2 line summary of proposed resolution>\",\"Summary\": \"<summary>\", \"ObjectKey\": \"<objectKey>\", \"ObjectType\": \"<objectType>\", \"listOfArticles\": [\"<articleId_1>\", \"<articleId_2>\"], \"listOfSimilarSrs\": [\"<srId_1>\", \"<srId_2>\"], \"Explanation\": \"<Explanation>\", \"followupIntent\":\"<followupIntent>\"}\n\n\n## Input Variables:\nuserQuery: {{$context.$system.$inputContext.content}}\n\nActionPlanTemplateNumberRAG Result: {{$context.$nodes.ACTIONPLANTEMPLATELOOKUP.$output.value}}\n\nSuggested Resolution: {{$context.$nodes.FINDRESOLUTION.$output.Summary}}\n\n## Output:\n## Summary Rules:\n- If no Suggested Resolution is found, display the message exactly as it is. Do not generate, modify, or infer any content, and do not use the user query to create a summary.\n- Provide a detailed summary with less than 1000 characters of Suggested Resolution.\n- Use Suggested Resolution if it contains clear, actionable steps that can reasonably guide the user in resolving their request.\n- Focus on presenting the instructions as a customer-facing resolution.\n\n## ObjectKey Rules:\n- Use the valid TemplateNumber from ActionPlanTemplateNumberRAG Result.\n  A valid TemplateNumber means not \"NA\", not null, and not empty.\n- If ActionPlanTemplateNumberRAG Result doesn't provide a valid TemplateNumber, set ObjectKey explicitly to null.\n- Do not generate your own TemplateNumber or substitute any other ID.\n\n## ObjectType Rules:\n- If there is a meaningful resolution summary OR a valid ObjectKey is found, set ObjectType to \"ActionPlanTemplate\".\n- Otherwise, set ObjectType to \"None\".\n\n## shortSummary Rules:\n-  value of  shortSummary is {{$context.$nodes.FINDRESOLUTION.$output.shortSummary}}.\n- If Suggested Resolution is missing or invalid, set shortSummary to null.\n- Do not add any extra interpretation or inferred meaning beyond what is provided in Suggested Resolution.\n\n## listOfArticles Rules:\n- {{$context.$nodes.GETINPUTCONTEXTUSEDFOROUTPUT.$output.result.articleList}}.\n- If no related articles are found, return an empty array (`[]`).\n- Do not fabricate or infer article IDs or titles.\n\n## listOfSimilarSrs Rules:\n- {{$context.$nodes.GETINPUTCONTEXTUSEDFOROUTPUT.$output.result.srList}}.\n- If no similar SRs exist, return an empty array (`[]`).\n- Do not generate or assume any SR IDs that are not provided in the input context.\n\n## Explanation Rules:\n- value of Explanation is {{$context.$nodes.FINDRESOLUTION.$output.Explanation}}\n\n## followupIntent Rules:\n - value of followupIntent is {{$context.$nodes.FINDRESOLUTION.$output.followupIntent}}\n\n## Important:\n- Do not leave ObjectKey as null if ActionPlanTemplateNumberRAG Result contains a valid TemplateNumber.\n- Always return a valid RFC8259-compliant JSON object."
            },
